summary: |-
  This was a long session. It started from two outside sources, a knowledge-graph reel (audited in neurons and discarded) and Anthropic's Scion article. It ended with:
  (1) Symbol Integrity Phase 1 shipped as 7.15.0, commit 259b7903 on feat/symbol-integrity, pushed.
  (2) Warpline re-prioritized for the founder's "armada" goal (many agent instances plus a dev team on one codebase), using a 4-agent team plus 3 Fable deep analyses.
  (3) The Warpline Console designed in Atelier, approved as the starting version.
  (4) The Warpline server, CI runner and hosting model designed.
  (5) Founder decisions TD-2026-10-14-551 and TD-2026-10-14-735, with tasks T-2026-10-14-001/002/003.
  Nothing about the server or console is built yet.
